# One-time projection-fidelity transition (remove after re-baseline).
#
# The v1.5.0 baseline openapi.yaml asset was generated by the earlier, lossy CUE
# projection. This PR makes the projection faithful: it now emits the enum
# constraints CUE always enforced and rewrites hidden strict-variant definitions
