### Evidence consolidation: the Evidence family moves to evidence.cue
#
# In the v1.5.0 baseline #Evidence lived in experimental auditlog.cue (x-status:
# experimental) while stable evaluationlog.cue consumed it. This change gives it a
# home whose stability tag matches its consumers. Relative to the published
# baseline each entry below is a change to an experimental type, and none removes a
# field or relaxes a constraint a producer relied on.
#
# payload: string -> any. The baseline projected payload as `string`; its CUE type
# has always been `_` (any), so the projection is now faithful (gemara#468).
response-property-type-changed Evidence
# source/* "removed": a false positive. Evidence.source became an allOf-wrapped
# $ref to EvidenceMapping — the encoder wraps a $ref that carries a sibling
# description, since OpenAPI 3.0 ignores $ref siblings — and oasdiff does not
# resolve through the wrapper. EvidenceMapping still declares reference-id as
# required and coordinate, digest, download-url, entry-id, media-type, remarks and
# size as optional; verified against the generated document.
response-required-property-removed Evidence
response-optional-property-removed Evidence
request-property-removed Evidence

